<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Understanding Artificial Theory of Mind: Perturbed Tasks and Reasoning in Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Christian Nickel
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Bonn-Aachen International Center for Information Technology (b-it), University of Bonn
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Lamarr Institute for Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Research Center Trustworthy Data Science and Security (RC-Trust), University of Duisburg-Essen

</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Laura Schrewe
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Bonn-Aachen International Center for Information Technology (b-it), University of Bonn
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Florian Mai
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Bonn-Aachen International Center for Information Technology (b-it), University of Bonn
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Lamarr Institute for Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Lucie Flek
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Bonn-Aachen International Center for Information Technology (b-it), University of Bonn
